    "updated_at": "2016-02-16T14:53:45Z",
    "body": "I think we should leave the spec as is and hope browsers implement `input` events everywhere. In a year or two we can revisit this if browsers still haven't implemented.\n\nNext step is probably to cc someone who could fix the bug for each bug. I can do that for Chromium.\n",
