    "body": "Thanks @annevk. I haven't found any yet, but this Gecko bug feels related: events fired on `<option>` don't bubble up to `<select>` https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1090602 (which we WONTFIX'd because platform/browser behavior is all over the place. See comment 27 and 34 and then test multi/inline select and weep because it gets more inconsistent).\n",
